rms, backlog timing or margin data.\n\n**Supportive**\n- **Orders:** H1 2026 orders were up 11% year on year, led by utility and data-centre customers.\n- **Backlog:** it reached C$5.1B, and management says it covers the C$4.2B guidance. That is about 1.2x coverage.\n- **Cancellations:** they were below 1%.\n- **Halbrook plant:** this is Voltaris's largest plant. A fire in the coil-winding hall took it offline for nine weeks in Q2 2026. It restarted in August at full capacity. Management expects to recover the lost shipments by mid-2027, which would add catch-up revenue to 2027.\n\n**Cautionary**\n- **Revenue run-rate:** quarterly revenue was C$905M, 960M, 980M and 890M from 2025Q3 to 2026Q2. The last four quarters sum to about C$3.8B, and Q2 2026 was depressed by the fire.\n- **Growth needed:** reaching C$4.2B needs about 10% growth over that trailing run-rate. Backlog conversion plus the catch-up could deliver it.\n- **Execution risk:** the catch-up depends on Halbrook running at full capacity with no further disruption.\n- **Backlog timing:** I couldn't see how much of the C$5.1B ships in 2027 rather than later. The 1.2x coverage is thin if part of it ships after 2027.\n\nn3 reached a different conclusion from industry data: about C$3.3–3.7B, well short of C$4.2B. The company's own numbers support guidance, but that outside view is a real counterweight.","ttft_ms":1934,"type":"result","duration_ms":36708,"uuid":"416ed8d1-b052-47e0-b8fd-784e975a3043","ttft_stream_ms":1638,"time_to_request_ms":578,"time_to_request_phases_ms":{"other":34,"system_prompt":30,"resume_other":0,"process_user_input":15,"input_attachments":77,"input_hooks":7,"conversation_append":0,"transcript_persist":48,"tool_pool_refresh":0,"init_message":74,"init_frame_send":7,"engine_pickup":11,"loop_entry":4,"message_prep":24,"model_config_wait":1,"autocompact":2,"request_announcements":139,"query_setup":15,"model_gates":17,"tool_schema_build":6,"message_normalization":12,"client_creation":38,"reques